%SIXMD 1
# @?MV - RENAME A FILE OR DIRECTORY

## DESCRIPTION

RENAMES OLD TO NEW USING THE NATIVE RENAME SYSCALL.

USAGE IS 'MV OLD NEW'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/MV
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/MV.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

